{
  "_about": "How people behave on a feed, whatever they are into. These are priors, not measurements of your audience: edit them, and override any of them per account or per segment in audience.json. They exist because a simulated person with no stated habits behaves like an eager focus-group volunteer, and nobody on a real feed is one. Most people lurk, most people watch muted, and most people are in the middle of something else.",
